# Heap census and VRAM tenancy around the Save States page (ss_mem.spec).
+600 census pre_menu
+2 dump game-pre
+2 menu
+12 census menu_open
+2 press DOWN
+2 press CROSS
+12 census page_open
+2 press DOWN
+12 dump landed-slot2
+2 press DOWN
+12 dump landed-slot3
+2 census page_after_reads
+2 press CIRCLE
+6 press CIRCLE
+30 census after_close
+2 dump game-post
+4 exit 0
